{"unit_id": "YB313__dsh-branch-tree#feature-1", "repo": "YB313/dsh-branch-tree", "commit": "551169b0111714e91a3087fcbd5165fbf390f334", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-branch-tree 的功能「从会话创建分支」：用户从会话发起新分支并命名，可选择完整复制、开头继承或压缩摘要；新会话独立运行。。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:2125-2152"]}
