{"unit_id": "YB313__dsh-branch-tree#feature-3", "repo": "YB313/dsh-branch-tree", "commit": "551169b0111714e91a3087fcbd5165fbf390f334", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-branch-tree 的功能「树状会话浏览」：左侧工作区栏和分支面板把母会话与分支显示为可展开的层级树，方便查看会话从属关系。。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:4298-4335"]}
{"unit_id": "YB313__dsh-branch-tree#feature-4", "repo": "YB313/dsh-branch-tree", "commit": "551169b0111714e91a3087fcbd5165fbf390f334", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-branch-tree 的功能「整理与归档分支」：分支树可重命名或归档会话；归档会遍历选中节点及其子树，并在宿主归档成功后记录本地状态。。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:2642-2700"]}
